
"smart_sources:Resumes/PORTFOLIO_REVIEW.md": {"path":"Resumes/PORTFOLIO_REVIEW.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"c5ee8m","at":1792348058868},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1778298774690,"size":11005,"at":1792348058869,"hash":"c5ee8m"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,14],"#":[16,134]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"PROJECT":"AppScriptFXNS","WHAT IT ACTUALLY DOES":"A suite of Google Apps Script (JavaScript) tools that automate Amazon fulfillment center (Ship Dock) operations. It parses \"Return to Baseline\" (RTB) performance data, generates \"Thrive\" reports, and manages dock staffing/roles by treating Google Sheets as a relational database.","PERSONA 1 VIEW — RECRUITER":"This signals a candidate who has operated in high-volume, high-pressure logistics and understands the importance of performance metrics. While not GxP-validated, it demonstrates the ability to build \"Shadow IT\" solutions that bridge gaps in enterprise software, a common need in pre-commercial biotech ops.","PERSONA 2 VIEW — CLIENT":"This is a turnkey workflow automation package for a small warehouse or lab manager. It takes messy, manual spreadsheets and turns them into a structured dashboard with automated reporting and role-clearing functions.","TECH STACK VERIFIED":"Google Apps Script (JavaScript), Google Workspace APIs (Sheets, Drive).","IMPACT SIGNAL":"The complexity of `RTBV3.0.gs.txt` (12KB+ of logic) shows deep domain knowledge of labor-intensive operations and the ability to maintain complex state in a low-code environment.","GAPS OR CAVEATS":"Lacks a modern CI/CD pipeline (e.g., Clasp/GitHub Actions) and relies on the \"gs.txt\" naming convention, which is a legacy way to version control Apps Script."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Resumes/PORTFOLIO_REVIEW.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"1a2mutu","at":1792348058868},"key":"Resumes/PORTFOLIO_REVIEW.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,14],"size":1392,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
